# Local Development Override Instructions
# =======================================
# 
# The .npmrc file contains platform=linux and arch=x64 settings required for Lovable deployments.
# For local development on macOS or Windows, you have two options:
#
# Option 1: Use environment variables (recommended)
#   macOS:   NPM_CONFIG_PLATFORM=darwin npm install
#   Windows: NPM_CONFIG_PLATFORM=win32 npm install
#   Linux:   npm install (uses .npmrc settings)
#
# Option 2: Temporarily comment out platform/arch in .npmrc
#   Edit .npmrc and comment out the platform and arch lines:
#     # platform=linux
#     # arch=x64
#   Remember to uncomment them before committing!
#
# Option 3: Create a local override script
#   Create a script in package.json or use:
#     npm config set platform darwin --location=project
#     npm config set arch x64 --location=project
